{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/04/15/0903923/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヤンジャン撮影のときの。\nもうみなさんgetしたかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブ\n2日目終わりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったみなさん\nありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/04/15/0903923/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は\n生駒ちゃんとまりちゃとみさみさとななみんとさゆりんが来てくれてたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/04/15/0903923/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんまりみんなと話す時間が無かったんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさみさが「花奈のことずっと見てたよ～」とか\n生駒ちゃんが「セクシーイケイケ美女で惚れました」とか言ってくれて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/04/15/0903923/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"w"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう！\n今日はいつもの髪型ではなかったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃんの言うように\nイケイケな感じの髪型でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前にもやったことあるんだけど\nなんて説明したらいいんだろう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ストレートで髪を耳にかける\nいつもの髪型も好きだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブには今日の髪型が向いてるかなって\n思ったから\nまたやろうかな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/04/15/0903923/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/04/15/0903923/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"体力もうついてきたかも！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も全力でやったつもりだけど\n昨日より力を持続できた気がする"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/04/15/0903923/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}